@api = https://localhost:7001
@accessToken = <development-access-token>
@refreshToken = <development-refresh-token>

### Development-only Admin login — parola için README seed tablosunu kullanın
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@company.com","password":"<development-demo-password>"}

### Development-only Manager login
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"manager@company.com","password":"<development-demo-password>"}

### Development-only Employee login
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"employee@company.com","password":"<development-demo-password>"}

### Current user
GET {{api}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Rotate refresh token — yanıttaki değerleri yalnız yerel placeholder değişkenlerine aktarın
POST {{api}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken":"{{refreshToken}}"}

### Revoke refresh token
POST {{api}}/api/auth/revoke
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken":"{{refreshToken}}"}
